      "content": "it's just so dark out here. i look ahead and all i see is more of the same... more dust, more hunger, more pain. i keep trying to find a reason to keep moving, but i can't find one. it feels like i'm just dragging a corpse around, and the corpse is me. what's the point of even trying to reach the outpost if it's just going to be more of this?",
